# Component Changelog & Lifecycle

Since its standalone release, all 161 exported components in TuffEx maintain an authoritative Since version. Every version bump is verified by an automated gate (`audit:changelog`), requiring an explicit declaration of impacted components and change notes.

## Overview

The current latest release of TuffEx is **v0.6.0**, exporting a total of **161** components.

- **Base Suite**: 93 general, form, layout, and navigation components
- **Pro Suite**: 30 advanced interaction, effect, and primitive components
- **AI Suite**: 38 AI chat, agent, reasoning, and context components
- **Gate Protection**: Bumping package version without a version chapter or component breakdown will fail CI audits

## Release History

### Version 0.6.0 (2026-09-12)

Tactile interaction overhaul and visual effects suite release, with stacked toast rewrite and enhanced controls.

- **New Components (13)**: [agent-screen](./agent-screen.en.mdc), [charts](./charts.en.mdc), [choice-card](./choice-card.en.mdc), [flowchart](./flowchart.en.mdc), [fusion-surface](./fusion-surface.en.mdc), [icon-morph](./icon-morph.en.mdc), [icon-picker](./icon-picker.en.mdc), [mode-chip](./mode-chip.en.mdc), [prism-glow](./prism-glow.en.mdc), [sensitive-input](./sensitive-input.en.mdc), [status-hint](./status-hint.en.mdc), [text-morph](./text-morph.en.mdc), [toast-panel](./toast-panel.en.mdc)
- **Updated Components (17)**: [alert](./alert.en.mdc), [badge](./badge.en.mdc), [cascader](./cascader.en.mdc), [date-picker](./date-picker.en.mdc), [flat-radio](./flat-radio.en.mdc), [group-block](./group-block.en.mdc), [picker](./picker.en.mdc), [progress-bar](./progress-bar.en.mdc), [slider](./slider.en.mdc), [sortable-list](./sortable-list.en.mdc), [stream-markdown](./stream-markdown.en.mdc), [tab-bar](./tab-bar.en.mdc), [text-transformer](./text-transformer.en.mdc), [toast](./toast.en.mdc), [toast-panel](./toast-panel.en.mdc), [transfer](./transfer.en.mdc), [tree](./tree.en.mdc)
- **Key Features**:
  - Added TxTextMorph character-level morphing, replacing third-party dependencies;
  - Rewrote TxToastHost as a stackable toast system with swipe-to-dismiss and countdown pauses;
  - Added handle and keyboard sorting to TxSortableList with live drag preview;
  - TxDatePicker and TxCascader support range selection and chained floating panels;
  - Added TxPrismGlow visual effect and TxStatusHint status indicators.

### Version 0.5.0 (2026-09-07)

Interaction feedback refinement and performance optimizations.

- **Updated Components (5)**: [card-item](./card-item.en.mdc), [dropdown-menu](./dropdown-menu.en.mdc), [filter-chips](./filter-chips.en.mdc), [slider](./slider.en.mdc), [stream-markdown](./stream-markdown.en.mdc)
- **Key Features**:
  - TxFilterChips supports sliding fill and icon-only modes;
  - Floating panels migrated to transform-based positioning with sizing middleware;
  - Standardized interactive cursor styles and clean PostCSS build artifacts.

### Version 0.4.0 (2026-09-01)

Component family consolidation and docs migration.

- **Updated Components (2)**: [button](./button.en.mdc), [icon](./icon.en.mdc)
- **Key Features**:
  - Consolidated TxButton and TxIcon families, removing legacy subpaths;
  - Removed deprecated TuffFlatButton in favor of TxButton variant="flat";
  - Runtime demos and documentation fully migrated to Nexus.

