### Version 0.3.8 (2026-05-29)

Drawer and divider enhancements.

- **Updated Components (2)**: [divider](./divider.en.mdc), [drawer](./drawer.en.mdc)
- **Key Features**:
  - TxDrawer supports 4-direction slideout and full-screen modal;
  - TxDivider introduces gradient alpha fade mode.

### Version 0.3.7 (2026-05-28)

Foundational input and layout batch.

- **New Components (4)**: [divider](./divider.en.mdc), [kbd](./kbd.en.mdc), [number-input](./number-input.en.mdc), [textarea](./textarea.en.mdc)
- **Updated Components (16)**: [avatar](./avatar.en.mdc), [chat](./chat.en.mdc), [flat-input](./flat-input.en.mdc), [flat-radio](./flat-radio.en.mdc), [flat-select](./flat-select.en.mdc), [flip-overlay](./flip-overlay.en.mdc), [glass-surface](./glass-surface.en.mdc), [group-block](./group-block.en.mdc), [icon](./icon.en.mdc), [input](./input.en.mdc), [scroll](./scroll.en.mdc), [slider](./slider.en.mdc), [stagger](./stagger.en.mdc), [stat-card](./stat-card.en.mdc), [tabs](./tabs.en.mdc), [transfer](./transfer.en.mdc)
- **Key Features**:
  - Added TxTextarea, TxNumberInput, TxDivider, TxKbd, and TxTransfer;
