## Version Gate and Standards

TuffEx enforces pre-publish verification gates to keep releases transparent:

- **Synchronized Version Chapter**: Bumping package.json requires a corresponding chapter in CHANGELOG.md and this page;
- **Component Breakdown Required**: Each version chapter must state which components were added or modified;
- **Valid Since Attributes**: Component doc headers and this index must agree, prohibiting speculative future versions;
- **Cross-Language Parity**: Heading structures between Chinese and English pages are strictly aligned and checked in CI.
